OL,3,GNEWSAFire closes Moray high school as
OL,4,Acouncil assesses damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FA secondary school in Moray will be
OL,7,Fclosed on Monday and Tuesday after a
OL,8,Ffire broke out over the weekend.
OL,10,FMoray Council said the blaze at Keith
OL,11,FGrammar School took hold on Friday
OL,12,Fevening.
OL,14,FThey said initial investigations
OL,15,Fsuggested it was not deliberate, but
OL,16,Fwould need to see a full report to
OL,17,Fconfirm the cause. There were no
OL,18,Freported casualties.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
