OL,3,GNEWSAFire closes Moray high school as
OL,4,Acouncil assesses damage
OL,5,
OL,6,FWork is taking place over the weekend
OL,7,Fto assess the damage and to ensure the
OL,8,Fsafety of the building. It is not yet
OL,9,Fclear when the school will reopen.
